P actions make_etude
P mode interactif
P ncpus 1
P mpi_nbcpu 1
P mpi_nbnoeud 1
P time_limit 180
P memory_limit 2048
F comm curved_contact.comm D 1
F mail curved_contact.mail D 20
F mess curved_contact.mess R 6
F rmed curved_contact.rmed R 80
F dat CONTACT.csv R 81
F dat MCUT.csv R 82
F dat SCUT.csv R 83
F dat SDISP.csv R 84
